# L §5.19 A link is judged by existence: "a `fulfils`, an observation's or a settling move's, naming an adjustment that
# no version made by that cut, or whose version makes no change to that leg there (§5.14.3)" is refused (RUN-RECORD);
# L §8.4 `<movement> fulfils <adjustment>, which no version made by the cut`. E6_3_residuals_adjustment.test's model
# with bank[r1] naming adjustments[wage[2026-04].cash, raise_2026]: raise_2026 governs March only, so it changes no
# April leg: the record is refused, and konto's balance with it (b); March's own adjustment stays unsettled
# (`adjustment:` in the register). (Was REFCORE-UNSPECIFIED §5.19.)
=== m.tally
model hh
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source plan "plan"
source act "act"
source bank_export "bank"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind wages: event certain
  leg cash: PLN
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input wage_amt: money PLN
input wage_dom: int
input bank: observed
def net[m in months]: money PLN = wage_amt at start_of(m)

move wage[m in months]: wages
  on day_of(m, wage_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from world to konto amount net[m]

version plan_2026
  cite plan
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  wage_amt = 5 000.00 PLN "umowa"
  wage_dom = 10 "umowa"
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"

version raise_2026
  cite act
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-05-01
  replace wage_amt = 5 500.00 PLN "aneks"

version back_pay
  cite bank_export
  governs 2026-05
  known 2026-05-20
  covers konto 2026-05-15..2026-05-15
  bank[r1] = (on: 2026-05-15, kind: wages, leg cash from world to konto amount 500.00 PLN, fulfils: adjustments[wage[2026-04].cash, raise_2026]) "line 1"

ask b: bal(konto, 2026-05-31)
=== expect
b: refused: RUN-RECORD bank[r1] fulfils adjustments[wage[2026-04].cash, raise_2026], which no version made by the cut
  adjustment: wage[2026-03] by 500.00 PLN on 2026-05-01 (version raise_2026), remaining 500.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: wage[2026-01]
  unfulfilled: wage[2026-02]
  unfulfilled: wage[2026-03]
  unfulfilled: wage[2026-04]
  unfulfilled: wage[2026-05]
  cut 2026-10-20
